<header><p class="st-kicker">colony · South Asia</p><h1 class="st-title">Dutch Malabar</h1><p class="st-meta">1661 CE – 1795 CE · capital Fort Kochi</p></header>
<p class="st-teaser">The Dutch East India Company's commandment on the Malabar Coast, centred on Fort Cochin and its pepper trade.</p>
<div class="st-body"><div class="st-text"><h2>Origins</h2><p>Seeking to break the Portuguese hold on <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pepper">pepper</a>, the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/dutch-east-india-company-territories">Dutch East India Company</a> (<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dutch-east-india-company">VOC</a>) allied with the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/kingdom-of-calicut">Zamorins of Calicut</a> and took <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kollam">Quilon</a> in 1661 and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kochi">Cochin</a> in 1663 from <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/portuguese-india">Portuguese India</a>. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/malabar-coast">Malabar</a> posts were organised as a commandment governed from Fort <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/kingdom-of-cochin">Kochi</a>, with factories at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kannur">Cannanore</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kodungallur">Cranganore</a> and Quilon.</p><h2>Rule and society</h2><p>The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dutch">Dutch</a> made treaties with the Raja of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kochi">Cochin</a>, making him effectively a dependent ally, and bought <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pepper">pepper</a> under monopoly contracts. The commander <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hendrik-van-rheede">Hendrik van Rheede</a> sponsored the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hortus-malabaricus">Hortus Malabaricus</a>, a pioneering twelve-volume study of the plants of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/malabar-coast">Malabar</a>. Dutch power was checked when <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/marthanda-varma">Marthanda Varma</a> of <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/travancore">Travancore</a> defeated them at <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-colachel">Colachel</a> in 1741.</p><h2>Decline and legacy</h2><p>After <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/battle-of-colachel">Colachel</a> the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dutch">Dutch</a> lost influence, selling <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kannur">Cannanore</a> to the <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/arakkal-kingdom">Arakkal kingdom</a> and later posts to <a class="enc-link st-link" href="/state/travancore">Travancore</a>. British forces occupied <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kochi">Cochin</a> in 1795 during the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/french-revolutionary-wars">French Revolutionary Wars</a>, and the territory was formally ceded in 1814.</p></div><aside class="st-side"><figure class="st-fig"><img src="/images/states/dutch-malabar.jpg" alt="Dutch Malabar" width="320" height="213"><figcaption>Image: Himasaram · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_the_Dutch_East_India_Company.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">source</a></figcaption></figure><dl class="st-facts"><dt>Years</dt><dd>1661 CE – 1795 CE</dd><dt>Centuries</dt><dd><a href="/centuries/17th-century">17th century</a> – <a href="/centuries/18th-century">18th century</a></dd><dt>Type</dt><dd>colony</dd><dt>Character</dt><dd>colonial</dd><dt>Capital</dt><dd>Fort Kochi</dd><dt>Rulers</dt><dd>Hendrik van Rheede</dd><dt>Religion</dt><dd>Dutch Reformed Church, Hinduism, Christianity</dd><dt>Language</dt><dd>Dutch, Malayalam</dd><dt>Today</dt><dd><a href="/countries/india">India</a></dd><dt>Also</dt><dd>Dutch Cochin, Commandment of Malabar</dd></dl><figure class="st-locator"><a href="/atlas?year=1728&amp;focus=dutch-malabar" aria-label="Dutch Malabar on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="6783 1806 640 512" role="img" aria-label="Map: where Dutch Malabar lay"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-tie" d="M7103 2062L5097 634M7103 2062L7364 1601"/><path class="map-dot-n" d="M5097 634h0M7364 1601h0"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M7103 2062h0"/><p